adly traps numerous  logs sharp objects and even spikes are  launched to the ground in a matter of  seconds as everyone scrambles to safety  Isabelle slips and nearly falls into a  pit containing pointed sticks luckily  Royce comes to a rescue and pulls her  out once the danger is averted the group  gathers around and discusses their next  strategy calculating the size and weight  of the traps Royce concludes that it was  not for humans but for something much  bigger and more dangerous nearby they  also find the rotting corpse of a U.S  Special forces officer when Nikolai goes  through his pocket he finds a document  which states that the soldier was  supposed to be deployed in Afghanistan  then Royce examines the corpse and  presumes that the giant creature for  which the traps were said might have  killed the soldier during their  discussion someone or something can be  seen keeping an eye on them through  thermal vision shortly after the group  continues moving forward and finally  reaches the end of the hill to their  horror they realize they are not on  Earth because the sky there seems  different now everything that was  thought to be strange starts making  sense looking at the alien Sky Royce  tells everyone that they need to come up  with a solid plan to return home however  just as the group enters the forest  again they are attacked by a pack of  alien dogs these dogs are extremely  large in size and move with tremendous  speed everyone takes out their guns and  starts shooting at the dogs together  they manage to kill most of them but one  survives and starts marching towards  Isabel she tries to shoot it with her  sniper but unfortunately it jams she  then reaches for her revolver instead  and Fires at the dog multiple times but  to no avail now with death imminent  Isabelle decides to commit the  unthinkable but suddenly a bell rings  and the alien dog returns back soon the  whole group gathers at a place and Royce  tells everyone that they are being  hunted he also asks the group members to  reload their weapons because the attacks  are unpredictable and because not  reloading is stupid but at the same time  Mombasa realizes that cucio is missing  worried they start looking for him and  eventually find him wounded and asking  for help for some reason he doesn't face  the group and keeps on saying help me in  a weird manner Isabel being the most  sympathetic person in the group decides  to help him but Royce stops her claiming  that it's a trap he then throws a stone  near cuccio to prove his point lo and  behold the rock activates a trap and as  a result the group decides to leave  cuccio as he is already doomed before  leaving Isabelle puts him out of his  misery with her sniper rifle but  strangely even after he's dead his voice  crying for hell can be heard now the  group led by Royce follows the alien  dog's Footprints and reaches a hunting  camp there they notice a strange  creature that has been tied up as the  group continues inspecting the place  four larger creatures arrive there and  brutally Gore mumbassa to death luckily  the remainder of the gang manages to  flee and jump into a river here we are  introduced to the Predators the real  Kings of the Jungle altogether there are  four Predators the classic the tracker  the falconer and the Berserker they are  large in size and use advanced  technology to locate their prey and keep  themselves hidden meanwhile the group  reaches a Shore and Isabelle yells at  Royce for using Mombasa as bait just to  catch a glimpse of the Predators Royce  defends himself by saying that he just  wanted to see and collect more  information about the creatures that  they're fighting against he then asks  Isabel to tell everyone what she knows  about the aliens initially Isabelle is  hesitant but when the group stares at  her in Anger she finally reveals that  she has heard of these creatures before  long ago in the forests of Guatemala a  team of special forces were sent out for  a regular drill but only one came out  alive from his report everyone got to  know about Bigfoot I mean about a deadly  alien creature that could hide itself  and shoot lasers from its eyes after the  Revelation Royce Riles up the group and  asks them to assist him in finishing off  the predators in the next scene the  group carries out their plan and makes  Edwin run into the forest as bathe as  expected one of the Predators the  classic catches wind of this and starts  following Edwin it appears as if the  classic is the dumbest out of all four  Predators as it fails to notice the  group waiting to shoot from a distance  the plan works and just as the classic  is about to launch towards Edwin  Isabelle takes a clean shot and kills  the Predator however when the group  approaches the corpse they realize that  Isabel had actually missed her shot  suddenly a human wearing an advanced  alien suit appears in front of them and  introduces himself as Noland he reveals  that he has been evading the Predators  and successfully living in the forest  for years following the introductions  Noland takes the group to his place  which seems to be a dilapidated  spaceship of some sort inside he tells  everyone that the Predators are of two  types small and large scientific he also  mentions that the Predators gather  Warriors and deadly animals from other  worlds and bring them to this planet  their main objective is to hunt and  improve their killing abilities just  like video games that's not why I play  video games Noland additionally Nolan  claims that the two sets of predators  have been at War for centuries hearing  this Royce comes up with a plan he wants  to liberate the smaller Predator from  the camp team up with it and gain access  to its spaceship so that he can return  back to Earth at night while the entire  group is resting Nolan secretly locks  the door from outside and starts  suffocating them with smoke it turns out  that he is a scavenger and his only  in