aining Predator as soon as  the Berserker attacks Edwin a huge  explosion occurs but it is still  insufficient to eliminate it luckily  Royce is prepared for this situation he  knows that the Predators locate their  prey with thermal vision so he covers  his body with mud and also lights fire  everywhere the plan seems to work at  first and the Berserker gets confused  but soon it tracks Royce's heartbeat and  attacks him in the meantime Isabel  starts regaining Consciousness and uses  every ounce of her strength to get to  her sniper just when the Berserker is  about to kill Royce she shoots it in the  shoulder taking advantage of the  opportunity Royce gets up and uses a  makeshift ax to decapitate the Berserker  and end the madness once and for all the  movie ends as Isabelle and Royce wonder  how they can turn back to the Earth  spoilers ahead they can't subscribe for  more videos like this turn on  notifications and leave a like to help  the channel out thank you for watching

